// (The) Late Late Show (Nat King Cole, 1958)

Tempo 125
Keysig F

Groove Metronome2-4
  z * 2
  
Groove EasySwingIntro2

Begin Solo
   Voice BrassSection
   Volume f
   Octave 5
   Articulate 40
   Harmony OpenBelow+8Below+8Above
   Begin Riff
       4f;r;f;r;
       4f;r;f;r;
       43g;;; ;;;
       4c+;
   End
End

Swell F mf 4

1         F6
2        Gm7 / G#dim7 Dm7/A
3        / / G#dim
4        Gm7 / Am7/F

Repeat
Repeat
Groove EasySwing
Volume m

5       Db9
6        C9
7       Db9
8        C9

Groove EasySwingWalk
Volume f

9        F7      /     E7
10      Eb7      /     D7
11       G9

Groove EasySwingFill
RepeatEnding

12      Db9      /     C9

RepeatEnd

13       C7      /     F6

Groove EasySwingSus
Volume m

14      Bb6
15    Bdim7
16       F6
17      Cm7      /     F7

Groove EasySwingWalkSus
Cresc mp mf 4

18      Bb6
19    Bdim7
20       F6
21   F#dim7      /    Gm7     C7

Groove EasySwingWalk
Volume m

22      Db9
23       C9
24      Db9
25       C9

Groove EasySwing
Volume mf

26       F7      /     E7
27      Eb7      /     D7
28       G7
29       C9

If ndef LAST 
  Groove EasySwingWalk
  30       F6
  31        /  /  C9
  Set LAST
Else
  Groove EasySwingEnd    
  32       F6
  33        / z!
Endif

RepeatEnd
